### MUTATES DATA: create water high-usage alert rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP Client high water usage",
  "utilityType": "water",
  "scopeType": "building",
  "scopeId": "{{testBuildingId}}",
  "conditionType": "high_usage",
  "threshold": 1,
  "windowMinutes": 60,
  "enabled": true
}

> {% client.global.set("testAlertRuleId", response.body.id); %}

### List alert rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: update alert rule
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/rules/{{testAlertRuleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threshold": 1.5,
  "enabled": true
}

### MUTATES DATA: evaluate alert rules
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "now": "2026-07-04T01:00:00.000Z"
}

> {%
  if (response.body.events && response.body.events.length > 0) {
    client.global.set("testAlertId", response.body.events[0].id);
  }
%}

### List alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: create an incident from an alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{testAlertId}}/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buildingId": "{{testBuildingId}}",
  "severity": "warning",
  "title": "Investigate alert from HTTP Client",
  "description": "A manager deliberately created this incident from alert {{testAlertId}}."
}

> {% client.global.set("testIncidentId", response.body.incident.id); %}

### MUTATES DATA: link another alert to an existing incident
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{testAlertId}}/link-incident
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incidentId": "{{testIncidentId}}"
}

### MUTATES DATA: acknowledge first evaluated alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{testAlertId}}/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: resolve first evaluated alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{testAlertId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Monthly usage report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly-usage?month={{reportMonth}}&buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Monthly usage CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly-usage/export?month={{reportMonth}}&buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Leak response JSON report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/leak-response?period=30d&buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Leak response CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/leak-response/export?format=csv&period=30d&buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Leak response PDF export
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/leak-response/export?format=pdf&period=30d&buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Audit events
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/events?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
